(text "PCB D: DISTRIBUTION ONLY. X3 receives regulated 5.0 V from external LM2596.\nX1 battery taps feed diode OR -> X2 LM2596 input; X6 -> X8 on ADC PCB B (sense only).\nNT1 star: separate relay VCC/JD-VCC. REMOVE relay jumper. J27 -> ESP; J31 spare 5 V." (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 0c53cff5-ff3e-5b6e-a7f4-c922fa3d7bd7))
